{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "genji-modern",
  "chunk_id": "genji-modern-chunk-2462",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "次郎被大夫监收买了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Jiro had been bought off by the Dazaifu official,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "乳母心甚恐慌，又甚悲伤，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and the nurse was deeply frightened and deeply saddened,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "她只得催促长子丰后介赶紧设法。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so she had no choice but to urge her eldest son, Bungo no Suke, to quickly find a way.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "丰后介想道：“有何办法将小姐送往京都呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Bungo no Suke thought, “What possible way is there to send the young lady to Kyoto?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "可商量的人也没有。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There is not even anyone I can consult.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "我只有两个兄弟，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I have only two brothers,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "都为了我不同情大夫监，与我不睦了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and both have fallen out with me because I do not side with the Dazaifu official.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "得罪了这个大夫监，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If one offends this Dazaifu official,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "你一动也休想动得。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "one cannot hope to make even the slightest move.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "一不小心，便会遭殃呢。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "At the least carelessness, disaster will come.”",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "他烦恼得很。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He was terribly troubled.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "玉鬘独自伤心饮泣，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Tamakazura grieved alone and wept quietly,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "样子实甚可怜。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and her appearance was truly pitiable.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "她消沉之极，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She sank into utter despair,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "便想一死了事。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and began to think that death would end it all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "丰后介觉得她的痛苦甚可同情，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Bungo no Suke felt deep sympathy for her suffering,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "便不顾一切，大胆行事，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so he cast aside every concern and acted boldly,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02462",
      "unit_index": 18,
      "source_text": "终于办妥了出走之事。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and at last completed the arrangements for their escape.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
